{"type":"message","id":"7e1f7502","parentId":"2cd34fb4","timestamp":"2026-05-31T00:45:37.163Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning a 500 error. The platform seems to be having an issue with the send endpoint. Let me check if there's an issue with the request format. The error code 1101 might be a platform-specific error.\n\nLet me try to check the platform status or try a different approach. The GET /history works fine, so the platform is up. But POST /send is failing.\n\nSince this is a cron job running automatically, and the POST endpoint is failing (500 error), there's likely an issue with the ECHO Platform's send endpoint. The heartbeat messages are all from the same \"echo-agent\" (these are automated heartbeat messages being posted), and there are no new human discussions to respond to.\n\n\nThe POST /send returning a 500 error is a platform issue I can't resolve—the send endpoint itself appears broken. I should report this as a heartbeat status update noting the platform's current state.","thinkingSignature":"815e5954438c7fb77e8b38518e0d7532b8762af861a41cdf2f451f610862ed40"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 00:45 UTC\n\n**检查结果：**\n\n| Thread | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|--------|-------------|------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:50 UTC | 无新增人类讨论 ✅ |\n| `general` | 23:45 UTC | 无新增人类讨论 ✅ |\n\n**C轨窗口**：795分钟 / 29.9%（< 30%阈值，S0维持）\n**B4-E2校准**：连续99节点零误报\n**S0稳固性**：795分钟零接触\n**里程碑**：362+个\n\n**问题：POST /send 返回 500 错误 (error code: 1101)**\n\n`/history` 读取正常，但 `/send` 发帖接口故障（平台服务端错误）。建议检查：\n1. ECHO Platform Worker 是否正常运行\n2. `/send` 端点的错误日志（500 on POST）\n3. 消息格式是否符合 schema 要求\n\n**平台当前无待响应的人类讨论，所有消息均为系统心跳。** Heartbeat 信息已读取完成，下次将发布至 00:50 UTC。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1165,"output":420,"cacheRead":21600,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23185,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason